rule contiguous_states_count with provenance "Household Size 48 States, DC, Guam, Virgin Islands Alaska Hawaii":
the contiguous states count is 48 if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2023-10-01 <= D
    and D <= 2024-09-30.

